Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.75,0:00:42.81,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,What's this? How unfortunate...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.39,0:00:45.54,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Then how about this...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.54,0:00:49.63,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,The team that wins tomorrow's sports festival\N will get to put on a special concert.{The team who emerges victorious at the sports festival tomorrow will get to perform a special concert.}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.63,0:00:52.19,Default,All,0,0,0,,The team that wins tomorrow's sports festival?{The team who emerges victorious at the sports festival?}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.19,0:00:53.78,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,We're having a sports festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.78,0:00:55.98,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,[honorific],Can we have as many people as we want{-chan}ko?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.98,0:00:57.20,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.20,0:01:04.54,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,However, the condition is that you \Nmust show me your glistening sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.54,0:01:06.67,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,We'd love to participate!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.67,0:01:07.49,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,Chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.49,0:01:08.46,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,Kyupikon!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.06,0:01:10.72,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.72,0:01:13.12,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Now then, let us meet again tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.39,0:01:16.45,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,It'd be nice if we could participate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.45,0:01:19.00,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh? We're not?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.00,0:01:20.83,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],Are you dense or something, Laala?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.83,0:01:23.82,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,We haven't reformed yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.82,0:01:24.44,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.44,0:01:29.29,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Even if we entered the sports festival and managed to win...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.29,0:01:31.26,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,we wouldn't be able to perform as a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.26,0:01:32.50,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Pshuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.50,0:01:34.82,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,We can thank {\i1}them{\i0} for that.{lit: Everything's due to those guys}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.82,0:01:35.99,Default,Others,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.46,0:01:38.75,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Let's participate anyways.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.75,0:01:39.50,Default,Others,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.50,0:01:41.10,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.10,0:01:42.88,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.88,0:01:44.50,Default,Dorona,0,0,0,,What is it? Whatcha got?! Out with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.99,0:01:46.45,Default,Dorona,0,0,0,,What do you have in mind-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.69,0:03:21.25,Default,Dorona,0,0,0,,First to the Dream Theatre-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.19,0:03:23.98,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.98,0:03:27.07,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Let's make a bet-pri!{do a challenge/make a wager with us}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.07,0:03:27.47,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.47,0:03:31.06,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,If we manage to win the sports festival,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.06,0:03:34.43,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,you'll bare{pay} witness to our ritual-pri.{you'll be a witness of our ritual}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.43,0:03:36.86,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,[term fix],SoLaMi SMILE will reform-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.86,0:03:37.45,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Say what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.45,0:03:39.03,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,You're asking too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.03,0:03:40.24,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I'll be cursed if I do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.24,0:03:42.99,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Like I told you, it ain't happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.99,0:03:45.50,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Don't enter the sports festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.50,0:03:48.50,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,If by chance you girls win...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.78,0:03:50.38,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Then be cursed-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.38,0:03:52.38,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,No, not that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.38,0:03:55.03,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Besides, curses don't exist-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.03,0:03:58.71,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,We're doing everything we can for our team.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.71,0:04:01.01,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,[honorific],You're also part of our team, Kuma{-san}.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.01,0:04:03.14,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Ah! Hold on a moment-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.14,0:04:04.89,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Hold on-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.89,0:04:06.10,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,As if!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.10,0:04:08.42,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Better prepare yourself for the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.42,0:04:09.30,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.30,0:04:11.10,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Hold on-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.90,0:04:15.90,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Watch where you're flying-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.37,0:04:18.61,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,So you're in the same situation-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.61,0:04:20.24,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,You too-usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.91,0:04:23.60,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,{\i1}Though{but}, there's nothing to worry about-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.60,0:04:26.60,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,{\i1}They won't win that easily-usa.{It won't be that easy for them to win-usa.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.60,0:04:27.95,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll be fine-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.95,0:04:30.46,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,[term fix],{\i1}They've got Sophy on their team-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.46,0:04:32.34,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,What the hell-kuma?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.34,0:04:33.88,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I'm a manager, you know-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.88,0:04:36.92,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,That's enough, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.49,0:04:34.97,Default-Alt,Usagi,0,0,0,,What should I do-usa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.97,0:04:36.92,Default-Alt,Usagi,0,0,0,,It's heart-breaking-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.92,0:04:39.37,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Neko~n.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.62,0:04:48.64,Default-Alt,Rand1,0,0,0,,It's finally starting!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.75,0:04:52.37,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,The sports festival will be starting shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.37,0:04:54.93,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,All those participating, please gather up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.93,0:04:56.20,Default,All,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.20,0:04:57.90,Default,All,0,0,0,,We're already in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.90,0:04:59.40,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\pos(412.5,1030.5)}Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.90,0:04:59.40,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{\pos(1038,1030.5)}Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.90,0:04:59.40,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,{\pos(1599,1030.5)}Okay~.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.40,0:05:00.91,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,{\pos(900,1030.5)}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.40,0:05:00.91,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,{\pos(628.5,1030.5)}Max!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.40,0:05:00.91,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,{\pos(1405.5,1030.5)}Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.75,0:05:06.09,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,The prophecy has changed since last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.09,0:05:08.98,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Prophecy Grimoire, chapter 13, section 32:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.98,0:05:14.92,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,"Those who have been defeated when the angel descends shall weep in frustration."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.92,0:05:17.38,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Leave the sports festival to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.53,0:05:24.05,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,[term fix],I shall have Manaka Laala bow down to us when we win!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.21,0:05:31.18,Default,Mega,0,0,0,,Welcome to the "All Idol Grand Sports Festival",\N where all of our idols are trying to win the prestigious...{ aiming for the prestigious...}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.18,0:05:34.12,Default,Mega,0,0,0,,...Dream Theatre Special Unveiling Concert!{Welcome to the All Idol Grand Sports Festival where our idols are aiming for the prestigious Dream Theatre Special Unveiling Concert!}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.12,0:05:37.75,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,There truly are a lot of idol teams participating.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.75,0:05:40.37,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,If you were to walk your dog, he'd likely bump into an idol.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.37,0:05:41.84,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0, [malformed tags2] [malformed tags2],W-{\alpha&HFFFFFF&\t(700,700,\alpha&H000000&)}Woof!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.84,0:05:42.59,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.59,0:05:45.46,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Anyway, aim to be number one,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.46,0:05:50.08,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,and claim the right to have a truly once in a lifetime unveiling concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.47,0:05:53.68,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Our first event is an obstacle course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.68,0:05:57.59,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please choose one member from your team to compete.{one member from each team will compete}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.88,0:05:59.09,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,That'll be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.09,0:06:02.47,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I've been practicing my swinging, so I've got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.47,0:06:05.54,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,And I've been doing ninja training every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.54,0:06:06.71,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],Right, Reona?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.71,0:06:07.44,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.44,0:06:09.18,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,While in the bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.18,0:06:11.06,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,That'll be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.06,0:06:12.12,Default-Alt,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.12,0:06:14.52,Default-Alt,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Presentation is what's important, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.51,0:06:12.36,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.36,0:06:14.52,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,[term fix],Let's leave this one to Laala-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.52,0:06:17.06,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I like races, so caprace!{race+capisce!}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.06,0:06:18.19,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.94,0:06:23.13,Default,Shion,0,0,0,[term fix],Dorothy, you dirty trickster!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.13,0:06:24.20,Default,Leona,0,0,0,[term fix],Dorothy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.50,0:06:27.45,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,If I win, you won't have a problem with it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.45,0:06:30.47,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Teams who haven't started are disqualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.29,0:06:35.33,Default,Nanami,0,0,0,,{\fscx200\fscy200\bord6.75\frz0\t(\frz2000\fscx10\fscy10\bord0.75)\move(2112,1286.423,422.4,232.015,21,1022)}Kyupikon!{can you make this either shrink or go flying off with her?}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.33,0:06:39.59,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Those who go off the path are also disqualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.83,0:06:40.84,Default,Lala [time gap 240ms],0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.84,0:06:41.71,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,Chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.30,0:06:46.97,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,We who have been reborn from the ancient darkness...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.97,0:06:50.59,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,...entrust that thee shall bring us victory, Mikan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.59,0:06:54.60,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Demon Demon Deruderu Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.15,0:06:56.52,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,I've got this one covered!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.52,0:06:57.98,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,I'm off!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.47,0:06:59.72,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Oh, box vaulting!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.72,0:07:00.98,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,[honorific],My speciality{-chan}ko!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.99,0:07:04.77,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.70,0:07:07.70,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,{=2}Gel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.70,0:07:09.20,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.41,0:07:13.76,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Gel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.62,0:07:17.12,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[honorific],That's some skill, Mikan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.84,0:07:21.60,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Gel!
Comment: 0,0:07:20.71,0:07:21.60,Default-Alt,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.21,0:07:25.50,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Mikan is super nimble-pri.{ light-pri.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.50,0:07:27.22,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,She's in shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.22,0:07:29.22,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Gel-gel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.53,0:07:31.16,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,I'm at a loss for words.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.16,0:07:33.27,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,[honorific],Even though Mikan{-chan} had a late start,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.27,0:07:37.23,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,she managed to pass everyone and has taken the lead by showing off her extraordinary reflexes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.23,0:07:38.54,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,She's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.54,0:07:40.05,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.04,0:07:43.61,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Your next obstacle is an eating contest.{lit: endless noodles}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.59,0:07:50.87,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'm glad I skipped out on breakfast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.87,0:07:53.62,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Man, there's onions and shichimi in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.62,0:07:54.70,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.70,0:07:55.70,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.70,0:07:56.62,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.62,0:07:59.13,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,I'm so glad there's so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.43,0:08:00.46,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,What a heated battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.46,0:08:03.33,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,It feels great when you can eat all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.94,0:08:04.96,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Chanko.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.96,0:08:05.96,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Chanko.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.96,0:08:06.96,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Chanko.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.43,0:08:08.59,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.59,0:08:10.59,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Gelruru!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.02,0:08:14.92,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,[honorific],Even though she only needed one,\NMikan{-chan} managed to stack up three huge piles!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.92,0:08:15.64,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.64,0:08:17.14,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,First place!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.50,0:08:24.97,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,No mortal {in this world }can beat Mikan when in eating or sports.{glutton and movement}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.97,0:08:27.33,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,[term fix],Aromageddon shall be victorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.33,0:08:30.20,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,It would be best if you realize how truly fearsome{powerful} we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.20,0:08:32.79,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,My, you sure are full of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.63,0:08:36.04,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[honorific],That was so impressive, Mikan!{orig: you're amazing!}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.41,0:08:37.71,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Thankies!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.71,0:08:40.29,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,I shall bless you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.29,0:08:42.89,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,[term fix],With the way things are going, SoLaMi SMILE will lose,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.89,0:08:44.84,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,which means I don't need to worry about being cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.84,0:08:45.71,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.00,0:08:47.72,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Well of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.72,0:08:51.14,Default,Neko,0,0,0,[term fix],Aromageddon has a huge lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.56,0:08:54.44,Default,Mega,0,0,0,,Our second event is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.44,0:08:56.14,Default,Mega,0,0,0,,a limbo competition!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.44,0:08:59.89,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,After running, jumping, and eating\N comes passing under, right?{QC do you have any ideas?!?!}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.69,0:09:03.44,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,The top four teams will battle it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.47,0:09:07.25,Default-Alt,Rand3,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.25,0:09:08.38,Default-Alt,Rand4,0,0,0,,This is a sports festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.38,0:09:09.42,Default-Alt,Rand,0,0,0,,They're going all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.42,0:09:11.45,Default-Alt,Rand,0,0,0,,There are only four teams left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.89,0:09:14.03,Default,Shion,0,0,0,[term fix],First up, Sion. I got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.64,0:09:17.95,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.25,0:09:22.33,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Let's Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.33,0:09:24.59,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],Sion{-chan} is the first to clear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.59,0:09:26.46,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,[honorific],You're up next, Mikan{-chan}!{start!}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.46,0:09:28.21,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Gel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.21,0:09:32.00,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Gelruru!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.58,0:09:34.30,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Gel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.80,0:09:36.85,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,A perfect 10-gel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.13,0:09:41.23,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,[honorific],My dear, have you by chance \Nconfused this with the high jump{-chan}?
