Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.79,0:15:20.76,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I'm sorry... I'm so heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.76,0:15:22.01,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,We're almost there-pri!{Just a little more-pri!}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.01,0:15:23.52,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'm completely capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.52,0:15:24.86,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,It's all right-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.86,0:15:26.53,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,You've done good enough-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.53,0:15:27.90,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,It's pointless to push on-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.90,0:15:30.29,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,If you work any harder, you'll end up collapsing-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.29,0:15:32.53,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Kumakuma, that's enough out of you-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.90,0:15:35.00,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,You're not giving up-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.30,0:15:38.54,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Do you want to perform that bad-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.54,0:15:42.54,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Well, I am a manager who's supposed to be getting them concerts...{I'm their manager who (is supposed to) gets them concerts but...}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.29,0:15:44.63,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I get it-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.11,0:15:47.55,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,So what if I come down with a curse-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.02,0:15:50.00,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I'll just end up completely bald-kuma!{I'll go completely bald-kuma!}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.00,0:15:51.55,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Okay, okay-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.48,0:15:53.57,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I got it-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.57,0:15:55.05,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Let's reform-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.05,0:15:56.56,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,So what if I'm bald?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.56,0:15:58.31,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I'm a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.31,0:16:00.31,Default-Alt,Kuma,0,0,0,,A man!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.31,0:15:59.48,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Really-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.48,0:16:00.31,Default,Lala,0,0,0,[honorific],Kuma{-san}!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.31,0:16:03.56,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Then the three of us... can perform!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.91,0:16:04.75,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,Pri! Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.75,0:16:05.62,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.62,0:16:06.41,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,Pri! Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.41,0:16:07.28,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.28,0:16:08.11,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,Pri! Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.11,0:16:08.94,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.28,0:16:08.94,Default-Alt,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}White, black.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.94,0:16:11.07,Default-Alt,DressingParfait,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}White, black.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.94,0:16:09.70,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,Pri! Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.70,0:16:11.07,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.07,0:16:12.64,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I'll break the tape!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.64,0:16:14.05,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,As the centre, I'll do it!{bit liberal}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.05,0:16:14.72,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.72,0:16:15.32,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.32,0:16:16.58,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.58,0:16:16.95,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.95,0:16:22.49,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.50,0:16:28.60,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.01,0:16:34.51,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,Promise: Believe in friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.51,0:16:36.51,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,Rhythm: Carved in our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.51,0:16:38.51,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,Paradise: Our goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.51,0:16:41.65,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,We swear to stand on stage as one!{naisho - Ya, I know it's more like Here we make our oath to do concerts or something, but I like theirs}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.17,0:16:44.63,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Don't look! Don't look-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.63,0:16:47.49,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,You'll be shocked by how smooth I am-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.49,0:16:48.93,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,What are you going on about-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.93,0:16:49.52,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.25,0:16:51.41,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,My gorgeous locks-kuma!{lit:  flowing (hair)}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.41,0:16:52.36,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.30,0:16:55.45,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Congrats on reforming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.45,0:16:58.32,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,[term fix],SoLaMi SMILE won!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.32,0:16:59.90,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Dearest spectators,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.90,0:17:02.54,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,you are welcome to take the subway from the TV station.{please make your way via the subway from the TV station.}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.89,0:17:06.29,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Now then, please proceed with the Dream Theatre Unveiling Concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.75,0:17:09.89,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,However, even though you'll be performing at the Dream Theatre,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.89,0:17:12.05,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,your concert routine will stay the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.39,0:17:14.18,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,So this is where we scan in?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.18,0:17:15.00,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.92,0:17:22.43,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Please form your Dream Team by scanning your Pri Tickets.{consistency item!  woot!  I hate making these}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.43,0:17:25.56,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.99,0:17:29.11,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.94,0:17:36.50,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,[term fix],At last, the three members of SoLaMi SMILE have gathered,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.50,0:17:38.19,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,and their matching coord is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.60,0:17:42.29,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,...a gentle and maidenly silhouette of spring in full bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.86,0:17:48.46,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,[term fix][honorific],Sophy{-san} shows off her new appearance with chic and mysterious colours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.86,0:17:51.21,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,Dream Heart Race Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.76,0:18:03.80,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.80,0:18:05.98,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,A new stage-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.98,0:18:07.77,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.50,0:18:09.74,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Hello everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.74,0:18:12.11,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,[term fix],We're SoLaMi SMILE!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.11,0:18:14.87,Default,Laphie,0,0,0,,Please continue to support us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.87,0:18:15.28,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.85,0:19:33.19,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,Making Drama Switch On!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.68,0:19:34.71,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Princess...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.71,0:19:36.44,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Where are you, Princess-kuma?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.94,0:19:40.02,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.45,0:19:42.39,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,Flower garden in full bloom!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.39,0:19:43.45,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,For you!{I'll go to you!}{>_>  ok, maybe too flashy}{maybe, just maybe, but it was also wrong}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.19,0:19:47.48,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,Lovely Flower Cinderella!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.48,0:19:49.45,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.64,0:19:53.48,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.92,0:20:39.89,Default,Fan,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.89,0:20:41.09,Default,Chanko,0,0,0,,Chanko!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.92,0:20:44.29,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,You've opened my eyes-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.29,0:20:46.38,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Your concert was beautiful-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.38,0:20:48.53,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,I will never waver again-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.53,0:20:51.64,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,[term fix],SoLaMi SMILE is the best-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.21,0:20:57.18,Default,Larelle,0,0,0,,They're huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.18,0:20:59.05,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,They're Dream Pri Tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.05,0:21:01.61,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Thank you for that wonderful concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.08,0:21:04.21,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Now go out and find two more,{Hurry and find two more,}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.21,0:21:08.84,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,and show us a true Dream Theatre Concert with the five of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.84,0:21:09.62,Default,SoLaMiSmile,0,0,0,,We will!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.98,0:21:14.93,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,They beat us to the punch. {got an early lead}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.93,0:21:16.73,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.73,0:21:17.92,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Let's try harder next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.95,0:21:21.77,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I shall grant the prophecy grimoire's baptism upon...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.77,0:21:26.75,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,...the one who possesses both black and white as well as the imp with a clumsy heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.75,0:21:29.21,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,[term fix],Now that SoLaMi SMILE has reformed,{became together}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.21,0:21:31.89,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,[term fix],you're setting your sights on Sion and Dorothy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.06,0:21:34.77,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.85,0:23:07.12,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Preposterous!{言語道断}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.12,0:23:10.12,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,The first concert at the Dream Theatre has already been seized.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.12,0:23:11.40,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,[term fix],It's all your fault, Sion.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.40,0:23:12.62,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,You just had to get in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.62,0:23:14.66,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,It's more your fault than mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.66,0:23:16.23,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,You were the one who screwed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.23,0:23:17.22,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}You!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.22,0:23:18.16,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}You!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.16,0:23:19.81,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Calm down, you two-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.81,0:23:21.41,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Are you really fighting again-usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.41,0:23:24.29,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,[term fix],Come on, Reona, hurry up and stop them like you always do-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.29,0:23:27.37,Default,Leona,0,0,0,[term fix],Is it already the end for Dressing Pafé?{QC Think of something better}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.37,0:23:28.30,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.85,0:23:29.76,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Next time:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.76,0:23:31.91,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,[term fix],Go! Farewell-usa?! {this might be 以後 too and not just Sion's thing but probably still fine either way}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.91,0:23:33.22,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Aim for your dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.22,0:23:34.72,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Let's go PriPara!

